<h3><u>Aik ahsaan kar</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><b><u><font size=""4""><p>Aik ahsaan kar</p>
</font></u></b><p><font size=""4"">Jub shaam ka bazaar a gaya</font></p><font size=""4"">
<p>Or cheeni gay jub chadar</p>
<p>Jub zaalim nay zainab(s.a) ka naam pukara</p>
<p>Zainab(s.a) zainab(s.a) zainab(s.a)</p>
<p>Yeh pukari ro kar</p>
<p>(Aik ahsaan kar meray ghazi(s.a) zaleemo say meri rida la day) x3</p>
<ol><li>(phir us ke baad kuch na mangoongi) x2</li><p>Zaleemo say meri rida laday</p><p>(Aik ahsaan kar meray ghazi(s.a) zaleemo say meri rida la day) x2</p><li>Laash to kab ki ban chuki hoon may</li><p>Dil to bas aadatan dharakta hai</p><p>Maar dalay na yeh sitam mujh ko</p><p>Meray bhai yeh mujh ko lagta hai</p><p>(jo chahta hai zindagi meri) x2</p><p>Zaleemo say meri rida laday</p><p>(Aik ahsaan kar meray ghazi(s.a) zaleemo say meri rida la day) x2</p><li>Dekh sajjad(a.s) ki taraf ghazi(a.s)</li><p>Tujh say karti hai yeh fughaan zainab(s.a)</p><p>Aik yahi bojh us ke dil per hai</p><p>Kahan bazar or kahan zainab(s.a)</p><p>(hai aik raah us ke jeenay ki) x2</p><p>Zaleemo say meri rida laday</p><p>(Aik ahsaan kar meray ghazi(s.a) zaleemo say meri rida la day) x2</p><li>Kaise tanay sahoon may logon kay</li><p>Ghum say phatnay laga hai dil mera</p><p>Sub yeh kehtay hai yeh woh zainab(s.a) hai</p><p>Jis ka abbas(a.s) jaisa bhai tha</p><p>(zabanay bandh karday tu sub ki) x2</p><p>Zaleemo say meri rida laday</p><p>(Aik ahsaan kar meray ghazi(s.a) zaleemo say meri rida la day) x2</p><li>Meri haalat meri gharebi per </li><p>Bhai nezay say khoon rota hai</p><p>Amma roti hai aur baba(a.s) bhi</p><p>Kyun ke ab waqt aisa aya hai</p><p>(ab aa rahi hai ik kaneez meri) x2</p><p>Zaleemo say meri rida laday</p><p>(Aik ahsaan kar meray ghazi(s.a) zaleemo say meri rida la day) x2</p><li>Karbala bas gayi hai aankhon may</li><p>Marsiya ban gaya mera chehra</p><p>Taziyaano nay ay meray ghazi(s.a)</p><p>Pusht per likh diya safar mera</p><p>(hai is kay baad bhi buka meri) x2</p><p>Zaleemo say meri rida laday</p><p>(Aik ahsaan kar meray ghazi(s.a) zaleemo say meri rida la day) x2</p><li>Ik sitam or bhi yeh baki hai</li><p>Kis tarhan tay yeh marhala ho ga</p><p>Haath rasi may or khulay sar hoon</p><p>Kaisay shereen say saamna ho ga</p><p>(ya ay moot ya meray ghazi(a.s)) x2</p><p>Zaleemo say meri rida laday</p><p>(Aik ahsaan kar meray ghazi(s.a) zaleemo say meri rida la day) x2</p><li>Dekhti hai mujhay najis aankhay</li><p>Naam mera shakee ke lab per hai</p><p>Kash kha jaye yeh zameen mujh ko</p><p>Aisay jeenay say yahi behtar hai</p><p>(yeh aakhri hai iltija meri) x2</p><p>Zaleemo say meri rida laday</p><p>(Aik ahsaan kar meray ghazi(s.a) zaleemo say meri rida la day) x2</p><li>Ja kay ""farhan"" un kay rozay per</li><p>Tum suna dayna yeh kalaam mera</p><p>Bibi zainab(s.a) kaha hai ""mazhar"" nay</p><p>Teri azmat ko hai salaam mera</p><p>(jo apnay bhai ko yeh kehti rahi) x2</p><p>Zaleemo say meri rida laday</p><p>(Aik ahsaan kar meray ghazi(s.a) zaleemo say meri rida la day) x2</p><li>(Phir us ke baad kuch na mangoongi) x2</li></ol>

<p>Zaleemo say meri rida laday</p>
<p>Aik ahsaan kar meray ghazi(s.a) zaleemo say meri rida la day</p></font></p>
